  "whatsNewBody": "Ajiye inda kake ajiye katunanka da lambar dakatarwa ta kowane banki. Idan walat ɗinka ya ɓace, za ka dakatar da komai cikin mintuna.",
  "whatsNewDismiss": "Na gane",
  "tutorialAddRecordMoreDetails2": "Ƙarin bayani yana ɗauke da ƙari: bayanin kula, maimaitawa, lokacin sabuntawa, na wane ne, inda kake ajiye shi, kulle da hotuna. Buɗe shi kawai idan kana buƙata.",
  "tutorialAddRecordProtect2": "Kulle bayani don ya nemi zanen yatsa ko kullin allo kafin a nuna shi. Zaɓi inda kake ajiye shi, kamar walat ɗinka, ka ƙara hotunan takardar.",
